{"ticker":"HINDZINC","symbol":"HINDZINC","instrumentId":3022467,"name":"Hind. Zinc","industry":"NSE-Mining-Metal Ores","about":"Hindustan Zinc Ltd. is India’s largest integrated producer of zinc and lead and the world’s second-largest producer of both metals. The company operates fully mechanized, environmentally sustainable mining and smelting facilities in Rajasthan. Along with zinc and lead, it produces silver as a by-product, positioning itself as one of the top silver producers globally. Hindustan Zinc caters to industries like automotive, construction, infrastructure, and consumer durables, where zinc is widely used for galvanizing steel. The company is committed to sustainable practices and resource efficiency, contributing significantly to India’s industrial growth while being a leader in the global base metals market.","website":"www.hzlindia.com","location":"INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:26:28.818Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":529,"changePct":0.3795066413662239,"week52High":727.2,"week52Low":454},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹2,23,519 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹53,364 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"1,647,874,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"407"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"304,921,905"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"2.08%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"9.88"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"20.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"0.08"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.33"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"9%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"10.73"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"10–41"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"61.1%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"40.21"},{"label":"Volume","value":"8,783,452"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"3,981,047"},{"label":"Master score","value":"63"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"88"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"49"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"160"},{"label":"Ac